              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 3,
                "start": 3
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Jonathan Hacker (Petitioners), according to Jonathan Hacker (Petitioners), all drug companies receive anecdotal reports of adverse health events, but such reports alone do not establish reliable facts about a drug\u2019s safety."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Matrixx",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "2bc59de7d107515e254046180a1cb85151bcb235630de4f1b8cb88360fffaea3",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-2bc59de7d107-0001-0001"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 30,
                "start": 30
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Matrixx, matrixx proposes a rule that would apply only in the hypothetical scenario where investors rely solely on the number of adverse event reports in pleading securities fraud."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Hacker",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "2bc59de7d107515e254046180a1cb85151bcb235630de4f1b8cb88360fffaea3",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-2bc59de7d107-0003-0001"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 57,
                "start": 57
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Hacker, the material omission is that adverse event reports told Matrixx that Zicam causes anosmia, which the company allegedly failed to disclose."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Hacker",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "2bc59de7d107515e254046180a1cb85151bcb235630de4f1b8cb88360fffaea3",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-2bc59de7d107-0003-0003"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 59,
                "start": 59
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Hacker, there is no allegation that consumer product sales were affected, and in fact they were not."
        }
      ],
